    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR TALENT - YOUR ENEMY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Justian begins to draw sketches filled with anger. He loses consciousness and finds himself in a completely different world. Ordinary things start to distort and reveal different sides. His apartment has turned into a space between reality and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614200/extras/612093c873102a8dddc6a137bb670550.avif?t=1755696358\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a nightmare, Yustian notices blank canvases next to a path leading to another room. Outside the window, there is thick fog, through which a small ray of sunlight can be seen. The apartment keys have disappeared, and the door won\u2019t unlock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The only option left is to follow the black trail...</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2D side-scroller with hand drawn graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric music and sound design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the complicated story of an artist who chose the wrong path in his life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide from enemies, the force is not on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual style based on a mixture of modern and retro games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person who was responsible for the program part, and for the art and music part of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614200/extras/0e74c2e4ee917034dad35a0d736416f7.avif?t=1755696358\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
